<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - TeleSpectrum downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - TeleSpectrum downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities said analyst Vivian Kuan downgraded TeleSpectrum Worldwide Inc to market performer from buy.</p>
<p>-- the company on Friday said it expected to report a &quot;slight loss&quot; in the second quarter.</p>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan's previous estimate for the quarter was for a $0.16 profit.</p>
<p>-- the J.P. Morgan analyst cut her 1997 estimate on the compnay to $0.20 from $0.64 and dropped 1998 to $0.65 from $0.92.</p>
</text>
